# Raiz Engine — repository ignore policy
#
# Scope: repository root. Component-specific rules may be added in nested
# .gitignore files, but must not weaken the secret rules below.
#
# Rationale for the secret section: on 2026-08-20 a GitHub App private key was
# found in the repository root while no ignore policy existed and the remote was
# public. Secrets come first for that reason.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and credentials — never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
.env
.env.*
signing.env
credentials.json
gha-creds-*.json
*.credentials
secrets/

# Keep templates: they carry no values and document required configuration.
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
!signing.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.pnp/
.pnp.js
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.uv/
pip-wheel-metadata/
*.egg-info/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output and bundler caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
dist/
build/
out/
.vite/
.turbo/
.parcel-cache/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test and coverage
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
coverage/
.nyc_output/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Staged runtimes and model caches
#
# Node, uv, yt-dlp, FFmpeg, WhisperX and Codex are fetched by the desktop
# `stage:*` scripts. The runtime manifest is versioned; the payloads are not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
resources/runtimes/
**/resources/runtimes/
**/python/whisperx/.venv/
*.onnx
*.pt
*.bin
*.safetensors
.cache/
.huggingface/
.torch/
whisper-models/

# Exception: runtime manifests describe versions and checksums and belong in Git.
!**/runtime-manifest.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated media and render output
#
# Approved source assets are versioned deliberately. Generated renders,
# previews, proxies and exports are reproducible and are not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
renders/
previews/
proxies/
exports/
**/out/renders/
*.tmp.mp4
*.partial

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# External references
#
# Third-party clones kept for consultation only. They are not product code and
# must not enter the monorepository. See docs/provenance/COMPONENTES-HERDADOS.md
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
cena-raiz/gh repos clones/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor, OS and local tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.shared.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and local scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
logs/
.scratch/
tmp/
